# Proposed dependency flow; root, tools and controls remain unqualified.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Proposed commissioning\nK281 decisions → k282 repair + whole review before k269\nRegistration / armed-role / input partition unresolved" {class: start}
Revision: "Accept requirements + identities\nWhole companions / tables; exact extracts"
Self: "Independently judge verifier controls\nOriginal results; no self-certification"
Qualification: "Proposed retained Task / script / CLI rehearsal\nRequired known input / image / domain controls\nB1–B8 scoped evidence; full contact gaps accepted"
Receipt: "Independently bind actual receipt\nIssuance profile → full current profile bridge\nProvisioning alone cannot settle LIVE eligibility"
Final: "After last provisioning / correction edit\nAffected requalification → independent audit"
Checker: "Pinned checker + pinned verifier\nHighest revision / full proof / receipt"
Channel: "Fresh one-use descriptor channels\nNonce / process / domain / held inputs"
Boundary: "Recheck before consume.intent\nNo refund; register / proofs absent"
Start -> Revision: "1 · freeze extracts / inventory / tool closure"
Revision -> Self: "2 · accept independent original controls"
Self -> Qualification: "3 · candidate cannot approve itself"
Qualification -> Receipt: "4 · qualified one-time initialization only"
Receipt -> Final: "5 · late changes invalidate affected proof"
Final -> Checker: "6 · no pending / weak / substituted binding"
Checker -> Channel: "7 · exact frame / EOF / verifier reap"
Channel -> Boundary: "8 · supervisor stays alive through return"
